      "id": "hana",
      "title": "Hana",
      "category": "People",
      "type": "Tower presence · unresolved identity",
      "dek": "A name associated with the tower near Larkhollow, a small doll and a dangerous larger presence whose relationship remains unclear.",
      "facts": {
        "Associated site": "Tower near Larkhollow",
        "Encounter": "September 2026 source scene",
        "Guardians": "Tik and Tok",
        "Identity": "Unresolved"
      },
      "body": "<p>Hana enters the continuation as someone Ryvyt regards as a friend living in the tower near <a href=\"#larkhollow\">Larkhollow</a>. His suspicion that she and a guarding creature might be the same being is a theory, not an established identity.</p><h2 id=\"hana-tower-encounter\">The tower encounter</h2><p>A voice identified as Hana refuses to let the visitors discover what the tower keeps hidden. The small figure falls inert as a doll; a distorted presence appears, guardians Tik and Tok attack, and a larger attacking figure is subsequently called Hana. Oya, Ryvyt and Pelagia escape.</p><p>What the tower protects, who controls the doll, and whether all manifestations share a single identity remain unanswered. Sylvi Fernstep later claims Lady Hana is older than local accounts suggest, without supplying a verified age or origin.</p><p class=\"source-note\">Scene sources: <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1547789358554423308\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1547801694996267129\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1547802560797351956\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1547806699912564746\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1547811278511284405\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">5</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1554710921967046697\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">6</a>.</p>",
